  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon brown sugar",
    "2 teaspoons dried sage",
    "2 teaspoons salt",
    "1 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "0.25 teaspoon dried marjoram",
    "0.125 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes",
    "1 pinch ground cloves",
    "2 pounds ground pork"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/F40Pd0R_ZpxGaNPPPvVx_iDt_x8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16359-BreakfastSausage-mfs-step1-0324-d2a342cce3aa468b9c57964bbb8179c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16359/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together brown sugar, sage, salt, black pepper, marjoram, red pepper flakes, and cloves in a small bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5ZG80yEZ0-xVBNENhvw8i9BrG4s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16359-BreakfastSausage-mfs-step2-0325-0de88d3e4f7940b6804e9f02f7fe253b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16359/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place pork in a large bowl. Add spice mixture and mix with your hands until well combined. Form mixture into 6 patties.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bVOyc2AbLJUvUYwL6dtuCw685iI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16359-BreakfastSausage-mfs-step3-0327-f7d82eea1c874bbfa3b8dcacd8d5488b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16359/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add patties and saute until browned and crispy, about 5 minutes per side. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 160 degrees F (71 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jywsRyX5FppEQ6h-lNQ2xzhvDs0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16359-BreakfastSausage-mfs-step4-0328-971314fc72ae464ea96664c6cc29de89.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16359/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
